dsh-task-console 0.11 contains a TypeScript semantic port of the durable
Kanban kernel behavior from Hermes Agent 0.20.4 (commit
6f31cfad7825a78b69c46eedbd31f2ac2abacfb8).

Hermes Agent is MIT licensed.
Copyright (c) 2025 Nous Research.

The port retains the normalized task/run/event model and its transactional
invariants. DSH task templates, Agent/Session bindings, worker tools, migration
layer, replay projection, and user interface are original integration code for
this plugin.
